  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 日本語版「ミツバハマゴウ」",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%9F%E3%83%84%E3%83%90%E3%83%8F%E3%83%9E%E3%82%B4%E3%82%A6",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 101841136,
      "text": "ミツバハマゴウ はシソ科ハマゴウ属の落葉低木。鹿児島県準絶滅危惧種。本種を含むハマゴウ属は、過去のクロンキスト体系ではクマツヅラ科に分類されていた。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 英語版「Vitex trifolia」",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vitex_trifolia",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 1371293169,
      "text": "Vitex trifolia, commonly known as the simpleleaf chastetree or blue Vitex, is a species of plant in the mint family Lamiaceae. It is a shrub or small tree native to coastal areas of the Indo-Pacific region."
    }
  },
